# DRAW keymap preset: Aseprite (default keyboard shortcuts - aseprite data/gui.xml)
#
# Format: actionId keycode requireMods forbidMods [device button]
#   mods bits: 1=Ctrl 2=Shift 4=Alt. forbidMods 0 = every modifier the row does not require
#   (Shift stays allowed on printable non-letters like > { + _ , typed with it).
#   A row that must leave Shift+key alone (Ctrl+] vs Ctrl+Shift+]) writes forbidMods 6.
#   Ctrl+Shift+punctuation is the UNshifted key with Ctrl+Shift: Ctrl+Shift+' = 39 3 (not 34).
#   Keycodes: letters are lowercase ASCII (Shift+letter = the letter, requireMods 2);
#   Tab 9, Backspace 8, Enter 13, Insert 20992, Delete 21248, F1 15104 ... F10 17408,
#   F11 34048, F12 34304. Action ids: GUI/COMMAND.BM (CMD_init) / SHORTCUTS.md.
# How a keymap applies (CFG/BINDINGS.BM BINDINGS_apply):
#   - an action's Nth row moves its Nth key; a row past the keys it has ADDS one
#   - a DRAW key a row takes is unbound (that DRAW action loses the key)
#   - keys no row takes keep their DRAW meaning
# Mac apps: Cmd is Ctrl here, Option is Alt.
# Already the same in DRAW (no row): B pencil, E eraser, I eyedropper, M marquee, W magic
#   wand, V move, Z zoom, L line, T text, X swap colours, Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y / Ctrl+Shift+Z,
#   Ctrl+C / X / V, Ctrl+Shift+C copy merged, Ctrl+A select all, Ctrl+D deselect,
#   Ctrl+Shift+I invert, Ctrl+B new brush, Ctrl+H show extras, Shift+O outline, Delete clear,
#   Ctrl+= / Ctrl+- zoom, Ctrl+0 fit, Ctrl+N / O / S / Shift+S.
# Not in DRAW (no row): H hand (DRAW: hold Space), Shift+C slice, Shift+G gradient,
#   D contour, R blur / jumble, Shift+R replace colour, Ctrl+U hue / saturation, Ctrl+M
#   curves, F9 convolution, P frame properties, Shift+P / F2 layer properties, Shift+X
#   layer visibility, Up / Down layer, Left / Right frame (DRAW: arrows nudge), Enter play
#   (DRAW: Enter confirms - play is Alt+/ / Num Enter), 1-6 zoom presets (DRAW: Z+digit),
#   Shift+1-4 layer opacity, Ctrl+Shift+D reselect, Ctrl+I import sprite sheet, Ctrl+R redo.
# DRAW keys this preset takes: F fill (moves to G), R rectangle, C ellipse, P polygon,
#   Q bezier, S smart shapes, H flip, [ ] brush size (they step the colour; + - size it),
#   9 0 opacity, , . grid size, Home / End flips, Tab toolbar, F3 pattern mode, F4 / F7
#   preview + symmetry, F8, F11 toggle-all-UI (Aseprite: full screen), Ctrl+E clear
#   selection (Delete / Backspace clear), Ctrl+T custom-font text, Backspace fill.
#   Kept because Aseprite leaves them unused: K spray, Ctrl+Shift+N new layer,
#   Ctrl+Shift+H flip vertical, Alt+, / Alt+. / Alt+Home / Alt+End frames.

# --- Tools ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
121 109 2 0     # Shift+M  elliptical marquee     -> Ellipse Select
119 113 0 0     # Q        lasso                  -> Freehand Select
120 113 2 0     # Shift+Q  polygonal lasso        -> Polygon Select
1702 107 0 0    # K        (DRAW's spray key, kept)
1702 98 2 0     # Shift+B  spray
103 103 0 0     # G        paint bucket           -> Fill
122 108 2 0     # Shift+L  curve                  -> Bezier
108 117 0 0     # U        rectangle
110 117 2 0     # Shift+U  ellipse
106 100 2 0     # Shift+D  polygon

# --- Edit ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
313 102 0 0     # F        fill (the selection with the FG colour)
306 21248 0 0   # Delete   (DRAW's own key, kept)
306 8 0 0       # Backspace  clear
324 115 0 0     # S        stroke                 -> Stroke Selection
315 104 2 0     # Shift+H  flip horizontal
316 104 3 0     # Ctrl+Shift+H  (DRAW's own key, kept)
316 118 2 0     # Shift+V  flip vertical
1401 116 1 0    # Ctrl+T   select content         -> Select From Current Layer
1805 105 5 0    # Ctrl+Alt+I  sprite size         -> Resize Image with Content
1801 99 0 0     # C        canvas size            -> Resize Canvas

# --- Layers / frames -------------------------------------------------------------------
701 110 3 0     # Ctrl+Shift+N  (DRAW's own key, kept)
701 110 2 0     # Shift+N  new layer
321 106 1 0     # Ctrl+J   new layer via copy     -> Copy to New Layer
323 106 3 0     # Ctrl+Shift+J  new layer via cut -> Cut to New Layer
2514 110 4 0    # Alt+N    new frame              -> Duplicate Frame
2511 98 4 0     # Alt+B    new empty frame        -> Add Blank Frame
2515 99 4 0     # Alt+C    remove frame           -> Delete Frame
2518 105 4 0    # Alt+I    reverse frames
2501 18176 4 0  # Alt+Home (DRAW's own key, kept)
2501 18176 0 0  # Home     first frame
2504 20224 4 0  # Alt+End  (DRAW's own key, kept)
2504 20224 0 0  # End      last frame
2502 44 4 0     # Alt+,    (DRAW's own key, kept)
2502 44 0 0     # ,        previous frame
2503 46 4 0     # Alt+.    (DRAW's own key, kept)
2503 46 0 0     # .        next frame
2505 9 0 0     # Tab      timeline               -> Animation Panel
2527 15616 0 0  # F3       onion skin

# --- View ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
434 16640 0 0   # F7       preview                -> Preview Window
2539 16896 0 0  # F8       full screen preview
453 34048 0 0   # F11      full screen mode       -> Toggle Fullscreen
2021 97 0 0     # A        palette editor         -> Color Mixer
2021 15872 0 0  # F4       palette editor
8101 39 0 0     # '        (DRAW's grid key, kept)
8101 39 1 6     # Ctrl+'   show grid
8102 39 3 0     # Ctrl+Shift+'  show pixel grid
8104 115 2 0    # Shift+S  snap to grid

# --- Colour / brush ---------------------------------------------------------------------
520 91 0 0      # [        previous colour (FG palette index)
520 57 0 0      # 9        previous colour
521 93 0 0      # ]        next colour
521 48 0 0      # 0        next colour
602 61 0 0      # =        brush size +
602 43 0 0      # +        brush size +
601 45 0 0      # -        brush size -

# --- File / app -------------------------------------------------------------------------
2535 101 1 0    # Ctrl+E        export sprite sheet
2217 120 3 0    # Ctrl+Shift+X  repeat last export -> Export Again
2100 107 1 0    # Ctrl+K        options            -> Settings
2360 107 7 0    # Ctrl+Alt+Shift+K  keyboard shortcuts -> Customize Controls
